                <label opaque="NO" clipsSubviews="YES" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" fixedFrame="YES" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="25" minimumFontSize="10" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="47">
                    <rect key="frame" x="103" y="156" width="600" height="440"/>
                    <autoresizingMask key="autoresizingMask" flexibleMaxX="YES" flexibleMaxY="YES"/>
                    <accessibility key="accessibilityConfiguration" identifier="rules.body"/>
                    <string key="text">Lab Solitaire is FreeCell solitaire 

In FreeCell the object is to move all the cards from 
the tableau columns below to the four foundations 
in the upper right of the layout. They must be placed on the foundations grouped
by suits and in order from Ace to King. Only the topmost card can be moved.

A card of a tableau column can be moved to another column in the tableau. As in
standard solitaire, you can only move a card onto another card that is one 
greater in rank and opposite in color.

FreeCell has four free "cells" in the top left of the layout where any card may be 
temporarily moved.

When a column is empty in the tableau, any card may be placed in that column –
it does not have to be a King.

Shorcuts:
 – If you double-tap on a card, it will be moved to an appropriate location. 
 – Multiple cards may be dragged if you have enough empty cells to have dragged 
   them one at a time.
 - Touch and hold Undo to restart the same game again.</string>
                    <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="MarkerFelt-Thin" family="Marker Felt" pointSize="18"/>
                    <color key="textColor" red="0.19758065044879913" green="0.19758065044879913" blue="0.19758065044879913" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                    <color key="highlightedColor" red="1" green="1" blue="1" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                </label>
                <label opaque="NO" clipsSubviews="YES" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" fixedFrame="YES" text="Lab Solitaire Rules" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" minimumFontSize="10" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="45">
